{"parse": {"title": "TNV-04", "pageid": 28139, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/TNV-03\" title=\"TNV-03\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">TNV-04</span><a href=\"/wiki/TNV-05\" title=\"TNV-05\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">TNV</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">04</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.A0.B7.E5.AD.90.E8.B4.A7\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"样子货\">样子货</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 样子货</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Decoration</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>它<span class=\"color-value\"></span>们<span class=\"color-value\"></span>并<span class=\"color-value\"></span>非<span class=\"color-value\"></span>无<span class=\"color-value\"></span>用<span class=\"color-value\"></span>之<span class=\"color-value\"></span>物<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>而<span class=\"color-value\"></span>是<span class=\"color-value\"></span>节<span class=\"color-value\"></span>日<span class=\"color-value\"></span>气<span class=\"color-value\"></span>氛<span class=\"color-value\"></span>中<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>重<span class=\"color-value\"></span>要<span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>环<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 190704</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_7_at_weixiukaiyishi3.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_7_at_weixiukaiyishi3\"><img alt=\"1_7_at_weixiukaiyishi3\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/Cg-1_7_at_weixiukaiyishi3.png/600px-Cg-1_7_at_weixiukaiyishi3.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/Cg-1_7_at_weixiukaiyishi3.png/900px-Cg-1_7_at_weixiukaiyishi3.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/Cg-1_7_at_weixiukaiyishi3.png/1200px-Cg-1_7_at_weixiukaiyishi3.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>既然来了，请先坐下吧——现在正是缺听众的时候。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>正如苏芙比小姐的房间中摆满了珍藏版提丰玩偶，温妮弗雷德女士的电视中彻夜播放的《今晚秀》——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这个房间中，有着各式各样能够凸显其主人品味的小东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>剑架上的兵器，桌子上摆放着的泛黄书本——从封皮上依稀能看出是一本笑话集。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>墙角摆放着一大罐油脂，而不远处，壁炉正缓缓地燃烧着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"303901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-303901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-303901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"303901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-303901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-303901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-303901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-303901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">泥鯭的士：</div><div>铠sir！油不能放在火旁边！会火烛的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>不用担心，安安小姐，这丛火焰来源于某人的追忆。它恒定、温和，不会产生过多的热量和烧灼一切的野心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>未锈铠用手去触碰火焰，火焰围绕着他的手指，如同一只温驯的良驹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"303901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-303901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-303901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"303901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-303901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-303901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-303901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-303901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">泥鯭的士：</div><div>铠sir，你是盔甲嘛，有话说是“真金唔怕红炉火”——你当然不怕火烧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>屋子的一侧，堆满了各式的小号角；桌子上摆满了缤纷的彩旗——数量太多，显得颇为凌乱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一只灵活的手揽住了绿色的小鸟木雕，轻轻地调整了它的朝向。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"303901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-303901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-303901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"303901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-303901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-303901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-303901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-303901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">泥鯭的士：</div><div>这些摆件是做什么用的？换一个方向摆，屋子里的风水会更靓仔哦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300710.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/HeadIconSmall-300710.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300710.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300710.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/HeadIconSmall-300710.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300710.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/HeadIconSmall-300710.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300710.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>这些是某人为了“骑士笑话节”准备的东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">雾行者：</div><div>骑士笑话节？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300711.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-300711.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300711.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300711.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-300711.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300711.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-300711.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300711.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>受到故人的启发，某人觉得这样的形式相当有趣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300711.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-300711.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300711.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300711.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-300711.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300711.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-300711.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300711.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>简单来说，这是一个说笑话的节日——所有的人围坐在一起，按照抽签的轮次，依次说出自己的笑话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300710.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/HeadIconSmall-300710.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300710.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300710.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/HeadIconSmall-300710.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300710.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/HeadIconSmall-300710.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300710.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>如果实在讲不出笑话，也可以说些有趣的故事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>至于这个木雕，某人特地在它的底部安装了一个机关。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>未锈铠伸出手指，轻轻地拨弄了一下尾羽。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿咬鹃木雕：</div><div>咔哒咔哒——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小鸟开始转动，片刻之后，淡黄色的鸟喙停在了雾行者的面前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>假如此时是“骑士笑话节”，接下来的讲述者就是雾行者先生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">雾行者：</div><div>这或许会是个有趣的活动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">雾行者：</div><div>但箱子里的各位都有各自的要事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">雾行者：</div><div>维尔汀小姐也因为“暴雨”几乎没有休息时间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">雾行者：</div><div>大部分人都不会有时间来参加这个笑话节。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">雾行者：</div><div>……说真的，我们需要假期。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>因为大家总是忙个不停，某人才想要复兴这个节日。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>不知诸位有没有发现，笑声与笑容，似乎都从大家的脸上消失了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>于是某人正在分享一些关于骑士的轶事——作为笑话节的预演。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>希望这些故事能够帮助诸位重拾幽默感——至少，放松一下紧绷着的神经。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"303901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-303901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-303901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"303901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-303901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-303901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-303901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-303901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">泥鯭的士：</div><div>哇哦！讲评书噶？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>为骑士笑话节增加剧目？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>这也许有助于骑士精神的宣传。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>不久前，某人为X先生讲述了一个在萨拉戈萨发生的故事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>在那个故事中，稍显莽撞的骑士罗兰与他的密友奥利弗，一起拜谒摩尔人的女王布拉米蒙德……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>虽然过程状况百出，但所幸有一个不错的结果。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>嗯……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阳光斜照，窗外有微风拂过树梢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>这样好的天气，让某人想起了数百年前的一个下午。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>那个时候，某人常与故友们一起共享茶点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>其中有一位十分英勇的女骑士。某人十分敬佩她。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>她曾经与一位名叫菲尔格特的巨人鏖战不休。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>历史上并没有记载她的功绩，某人为她深感不平。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>事实上，这场战役某人亦参与其中。某人认为这是一个相当有趣的故事，夏利小姐曾建议某人将其改编为戏剧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>请允许某人从头开始讲述这个故事。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "TNV-04"}}